{%- doc -%}
  Card diagnostic. Does nothing for normal visitors (one line of script; the diagnostic itself is assets/card-diagnostic.js, fetched only with the query). Open any page with ?card-diagnostic=1 (for example
  /pages/make-a-bundle?card-diagnostic=1) and a panel appears at the bottom with a "Copy report" button. The report describes the FIRST product card on
  the page in THIS browser: computed colours, color-scheme, the ancestors and their colour-scheme classes, matchMedia results, the device, saved
  state (localStorage keys, cookie names) and the stylesheet rules that win for the text area's background. Nothing is sent anywhere.

  @example
  {% render 'moment-card-diagnostic' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

<script>if (/[?&](card-diagnostic|view=card-diagnostic)(=|&|$)/.test(location.search)) import('{{ 'card-diagnostic.js' | asset_url }}');</script>
